				<r3d:description language="eng">The Base of Knowledge Bialystok University of Technology archives and makes available digital versions of documents and research data collected, processed or produced as part of scientific research or development work of BUT employees. Detailed rules for depositing are specified in the Regulations.
The BUT Data Repository is part of the BUT Base of Knowlegde and is open. 
Full texts of articles, monographs, chapters and other documents are made available in an open model, respecting the copyright and property rights of third parties, including the publisher.
Research data are made available in three models: open (Open Access), embargo (Embargo) and closed (Restricted Access). Depositing data is possible after logging into, the BUT Base of Knowledge, according to the instruction. The deposit policy is in line with the FAIR principles. Each dataset is given a unique DOI identifier. It is possible to choose a Creative Commons license for shared datasets.</r3d:description>
